*.pyc
.agents/TEMP/

# dex-agent fork: living project state under .agents is versioned (94 files were
# already tracked while the whole directory was ignored). Default deny stays above;
# only these paths are re-included. scripts/, receipts/, TEMP/ and the generated
# graphs remain ignored: untracked scripts there carry local paths and
# credential-shaped lines, and new scripts are added one by one with `git add -f`.
!.agents/ACTIVE.md
!.agents/CODE-REVIEW-GRAPH-INDEX.md
!.agents/GATILHOS-VIVOS.md
!.agents/HANDOFF.md
!.agents/INDEX.md
!.agents/PENDENTES.md
!.agents/lembranca.md
!.agents/napkin.md
!.agents/ESTACIONAMENTO/
!.agents/LIXEIRA/
!.agents/PLAN-TASKS/
!.agents/memorias/
!.agents/.dex-memoria/
